    <guid isPermaLink="false">65a54a2eab66818faf3f7e3b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 15 Jan 2024 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上一期我们聊了沈阳洗浴的传统文化 这一期Frankie和韩姐来和大家聊一聊我们两个的沈阳私心推荐，当我们的南方小伙伴来沈阳找我们玩我们都会怎么招待且</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Frankie 韩姐</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="283">04:43</a> 西塔美食地图</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">23:00</a> 回民美食 长膘神器</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1733">28:53</a> 老北市的庙会 小河沿的早市 彩电塔夜市 便是三餐四季的集市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 每一只鸡听到这里都开始颤抖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2290">38:10</a> 东北菜不踩雷合集</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3052">50:52</a> 沈阳老妹儿晚上当然要去蹦大迪</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/luHVwWJgEpfPYRRjtENOLhsjZ8yR.m4a" length="58887849" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:00:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FshxwgpztRI3AMvAdaqjMFM4ickd.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.009 全国洗浴看东北 东北洗浴看沈阳</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/659c1ab41519ccb103c6d1db</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">659c1ab41519ccb103c6d1db</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 08 Jan 2024 15:54:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>虽然沈阳不是旅游城市但是现在去沈阳旅游已经成了一种新的流行，沈阳作为洗浴之都更是最近频上热搜。今天三位主播就来一起唠唠沈阳洗澡这些事</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：Frankie 韩姐 老刘</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">02:40</a> 洗浴中心都在卷什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 正经沈阳人从小咋洗澡的-儿时的刑场 成人后的欢乐场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 五块钱洗澡的大众浴池进校园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a> 技术才是硬通货 大姨搓澡有口诀的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1049">17:29</a> 浴室里的显眼包们还是投降入乡随俗吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1224">20:24</a> 关于沈阳洗浴怎么被Frankie妖魔化传播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1519">25:19</a> 南方小伙伴们现在不用经历的泡澡噩梦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1875">31:15</a> 休息大厅欢乐多 沈阳洗浴大厅吊打北海道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2200">36:40</a> 北京洗澡没洗透，北京小伙伴们推荐一下北京浴室？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2536">42:16</a> 不红着出来就不能叫汗蒸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2748">45:48</a> 许愿环节 愿早日还愿</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhq49yHuDAYXgOgDU49tL-xUDkQR.m4a" length="47911880" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:37</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoFZLCYVr7a_tT5EknBO0vyVXAAp.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>vol.008 拔草指北之 那些年，我们用过的鸡肋好物</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6591b532c7f190eb73976cec</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6591b532c7f190eb73976cec</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 31 Dec 2023 18:38:41 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从“剁手”到“姐妹们买它”，过去十年我们经历过的消费主义陷阱还少吗？但是怎么就是管不住自己的好奇心总是买一些垃圾回家。本期节目两位主播一起为大家介绍曾经兴致勃勃买回家的垃圾，希望大家都少花冤枉钱，好钱用在刀刃上！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 震惊！Frankie的理想生活竟然是！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 最美工位其实就是垃圾堆？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 推开魔法世界的大门原来这么简单，没有什么事情是一根油条解决不了的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">16:55</a> “ 因为它的头太小了”这是什么虎狼之词！？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> 荧光彩虹妆-时代的眼泪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1949">32:29</a> 如果手机有皮肤之人民币玩家的花式玩法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2979">49:39</a> 幸福人生秘诀就是做一个对食物有追求的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3652">1:00:52</a> 不怕辛劳的人先享受橙汁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3884">1:04:44</a> 洗脸永动机怎么可以没有它？永远洗不干净的脸都是因为它！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4060">1:07:40</a> 新时代的中医主打一个赛博养生加智商税</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4270">1:11:10</a> 每一个女孩都永远缺件衣服的代价就是累弯了腰的晾衣架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4471">1:14:31</a> 吃灰就吃饱了，还吃什么虫虫</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4918">1:21:58</a> 谁说现代人要高科技养宠？哦，是赚钱机器说的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5478">1:31:18</a> 是我变了，是我不爱你了，是我不再需要你了</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lr5SBeerRTC48YgUjllmyQJeeHnC.m4a" length="93146151" type="audio/mp4"/>
